            \n                              <strong>B99</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The relay coil \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>R2</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is energized by\nan earth signal when one of the steering switches is closed; these\nswitches are connected via the clock spring \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>D47.</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              The relay\nsupplies the high tone horn \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>P10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              and the low tone horn\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>P11.</strong></p>"]]